  "news": [
    {"id": 3, "date": "Sat 7 Nov", "title": "GAME DAY – PAST THE HALFWAY MARK!", "text": "It's game day, and today takes us past the halfway point of the season. Every point counts and every rally matters. Remember, the top four in each division after Round 7 make the finals, so today is a big one for the ladder. Good luck to all teams today. Have fun, play in the spirit of pickle, and we'll see you on the courts."},
    {"id": 2, "date": "Mon 19 Oct", "title": "ROUND 1 DONE – WELL PLAYED!", "text": "Congrats on a great first round of Trader Jack's Pickleball League 4. The spirit of pickle is alive and well! Round 1 results and ladders are now in the app. Next up is Saturday 24 Oct at Avatea Hall: Division 1 at 1pm, Division 2 at 2pm, Division 3 at 3pm. Don't be late! We were a bit lenient on Monday, but from Saturday a team will be penalised 1 point for every minute it is late, so every game starts on time. Well done everyone."},
    {"id": 1, "date": "Welcome", "title": "WELCOME TO TJPL4", "text": "Find your team under Team, check the fixtures for every round, and follow the ladders. Scores are entered by PCI after each round, so check back after play. Round 1 is Mon 19 Oct at TSA, then Saturdays at Avatea Hall from 24 Oct."}
  ],
